# Left out of a `vercel deploy` upload. The CLI does not read .gitignore: without this file it
# uploads everything that is ignored there too. The local build, run state, review output and the
# ignored screenshots and reports stay out; capture/ itself is uploaded, because the remote build
# reads it (hosting-vercel.md).
/dist/
/.conversion/
/review/
/capture/screens/
/capture/lighthouse-live/
